     "body": "<p>Plan is to link to external copies of the same image files as are stored in the repository, currently served our of the Apache webserver here: <a href=\"http://www.lib.umd.edu/plantpatents/binaries/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.lib.umd.edu/plantpatents/binaries/</a></p>\n\n<p>If and when those binaries are not longer being served out of that location, this dataset will be less useful and can be updated or replaced with something else.</p>",
